# core.autocrlf is commonly true on Windows checkouts of this repo. The capture
# fixtures in testdata/ must survive byte-for-byte -- a single inserted CR would
# desynchronise the DVC bit-stream and make every replay meaningless. Git's
# NUL-byte heuristic already classifies them as binary, but do not rely on a
# heuristic for test data.
*.bin binary
*.png binary
*.jar binary
